---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import PersonalPortrait from './PersonalPortrait.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const root = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section id="about" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <SectionHeading number="03" title="A little about me" id="about-heading" note="Experience Architecture / Michigan State University" />
  <div class="about-grid"><PersonalPortrait /><div class="about-introduction"><p class="about-lead">I want to make digital experiences easier to access, understand, and use—so more people can take part with confidence.</p><p>I’m an Experience Architecture student at Michigan State University. My portfolio includes collaborative academic projects and independent prototypes developed with AI assistance. I make my contribution clear and distinguish what the evidence shows from what still needs to be tested.</p><p>I’m completing my B.A. in Experience Architecture with one credit remaining and expected graduation in December 2026.</p><p>I’m seeking UX Designer, Product Designer, Interaction Designer, and Information Architect roles.</p><details class="approach-details"><summary>My approach and tools</summary><dl class="capability-list" aria-label="Demonstrated capabilities and tools"><div><dt>Design</dt><dd>Information architecture, task flows, interface design, and prototyping. Explore the <a href={`${root}work/d2l-redesign/#evaluation`}>D2L evaluation</a> and <a href={`${root}work/community-spaces/#research`}>Community Spaces research context</a>.</dd></div><div><dt>Implementation</dt><dd>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, responsive components, and keyboard and accessibility checks. <a href={`${root}work/apple-ring/#implementation`}>Apple Ring documents my contribution and AI-assisted implementation</a>.</dd></div><div><dt>Tools</dt><dd>Figma, Git, and <a href={site.github}>GitHub</a>.</dd></div></dl></details><aside id="resume" class="resume-note" aria-labelledby="resume-heading"><h3 id="resume-heading">Resume</h3>{site.resumeHref ? <><p>One-page PDF. View online or save a copy.</p><div class="resume-actions"><a class="text-link" href={site.resumeHref}>Read the resume (PDF) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={site.resumeHref} download="suleyman-koncagul-resume.pdf">Download resume <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></> : <><p>The resume is awaiting owner approval for this review. Dates and employment details will be published only after confirmation.</p><span class="content-note">Resume pending approval</span></>}</aside><details class="site-implementation"><summary>About this site</summary><p>This portfolio uses Astro, TypeScript, semantic HTML, and CSS. Project records include evidence references; automated checks cover content provenance, keyboard navigation, responsive layouts, and accessibility.</p><p><strong>One implementation decision.</strong> Navigation and project content are rendered as HTML, so they remain available without JavaScript. The theme toggle is an optional enhancement: it stays hidden without JavaScript, and still works for the current page if browser storage is blocked.</p><p>This draft was developed with AI coding assistance. The source and review history document implementation and checks; they do not imply sole authorship.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/koncagu2-cloud/enhanced-portfolio">View the portfolio source and review history</a></p></details></div></div>
</section>
<style>
  .about-grid > div > p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .capability-list { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
  .capability-list > div { padding-block: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .capability-list dt { font: var(--text-meta)/1.5 var(--font-meta); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .capability-list dd { margin: .5rem 0 0; font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .resume-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1.5rem; }
</style>
